872
00:29:44,759 --> 00:29:47,662
Some years bring vacancies and big repairs.

873
00:29:47,842 --> 00:29:49,758
Others bring rising rents.

874
00:29:49,938 --> 00:29:51,224
After twenty years,

875
00:29:51,224 --> 00:29:53,188
the mortgage is much smaller,

876
00:29:53,188 --> 00:29:54,204
rent has grown,

877
00:29:54,204 --> 00:29:56,507
and the property may be worth much

878
00:29:56,507 --> 00:29:56,845
