881
00:30:01,857 --> 00:30:02,029
it.

882
00:30:02,379 --> 00:30:04,191
The third starts a business.

883
00:30:04,371 --> 00:30:06,705
The first attempt fails and costs half

884
00:30:06,705 --> 00:30:07,319
